# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

Provisions an LKS (Latitude Kubernetes Service) cluster control plane. Worker capacity is added separately through node pools, which this provider does not yet support.

`project`, `site` and `network` have no update endpoint and force a new resource if changed. `name`, `description` and `kubernetes_version` update in place; setting a newer `kubernetes_version` consents to an in-place control-plane upgrade.

